# Schneider manual transfer list — Ping + Policy Studio

Updated: 24 November 2026. Chris will apply client-side changes manually.
Remote application statuses remain pending until Chris confirms completion.

Files for the existing applications/logai/ chart:

- values.yaml — use the shared verified image pins and opt-in migration settings.
- values-eu-west-3-eks-shared-dev.yaml — inherit shared images and keep PreSync disabled
  until JFrog promotion and Schneider UAT checks are complete.
- templates/19-logai-api-migration.yaml — add or update the Flyway PreSync Job.
- templates/20-logai-api.yaml — retain the current version if it already includes
  the policy ConfigMap mapping and credential recovery. It shares the API image pin
  with the Job. The existing 30-logai-ui.yaml honors the shared image digest.

Conditional checks:

- [ ] Existing client Argo Application/ApplicationSet — verify approved revision,
      chart and UAT value-file selection. Retain the existing client resource.
- [ ] Client-managed policy ConfigMap — use only for an existing storage profile
      or approved snapshot-use flags. Optional inputs stay unset.

